[b]CCS 1.0.0-alpha.2-hotfix.1[/b]

[list]
[*]Assigning a move works again. In alpha.2 every assignment was refused with "[json.exception.out_of_range.403] key 'options' not found": the check that validates a menu event still looked for the candidate list on each slot after the list had moved to the page. Slots and settings saved by alpha.2 are kept.[/*]
[/list]

Update: close the game, extract the ZIP into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep settings.json and presets/.
